From 427e9e72ad3f45fe9c7f1bcf89f996e2ce46b710 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tony Gutierrez <anthony.gutierrez@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:11:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [rocr][rocjitsu] Require explicit hotswap enablement

Avoid loading the gfx1250 translator into every supported process.
Keep hotswap disabled unless HSA_HOTSWAP_ENABLE is truthy.

Remove the retired HSA_HOTSWAP_DISABLE switch and align the runtime
documentation, rocjitsu user guide, corpus launchers, and debugger
qualification with the default-off behavior.

Signed-off-by: Tony Gutierrez <anthony.gutierrez@amd.com>
